    "name": "Poker Warlords",
    "steam_appid": 1961710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/01d5c92d659e8fcb8ae71d0b2208d99a.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>In Poker Warlords, each card dealt spawns a medieval fantasy army! You might get dealt a mighty 10 out of 10 Dragons or you might get a measly 8 out of 24 Footmen. Play traditional poker betting rounds with face-down and face-up cards, then choose which two armies will fight for you in battle. You have to know when to hold 'em and when to fold 'em!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/4289ab9c8b06e826b2e77dd096c42d7a.poster.avif?t=1752294894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/4289ab9c8b06e826b2e77dd096c42d7a.webm?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/4289ab9c8b06e826b2e77dd096c42d7a.mp4?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ea8dabefea6e878bad02d63f26bc26a9.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Bet smart, battle hard, then win big! After the final bet the fight begins. Armies clash in fast-paced autobattler combat. No micromanagement\u2014just smart bets, unit counters, and tactical positioning. The last army standing takes the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/e20712b9f6c6ff33044a729eb860b308.poster.avif?t=1752294894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/e20712b9f6c6ff33044a729eb860b308.webm?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/e20712b9f6c6ff33044a729eb860b308.mp4?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ee8cf7ff3c5a0b7f7d5437815a5ff8a1.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Poker is a game of deception\u2014and so is war. Read your opponents, raise with confidence, and force them to fold before the battle even starts. But be careful\u2014each unit has strengths and weaknesses. Did they just show Specters, immune to physical damage? You don't have any magic damage, but you raised anyways. You wouldn't be crazy enough to do that... would you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rich combat system provides a complementary layer to the poker betting, creating a new experience unlike any other. Each hand creates a new opportunity to flex your strategic muscle and gather all the chips into your stack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/315013afac238f5081e51273b6d590eb.poster.avif?t=1752294894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/315013afac238f5081e51273b6d590eb.webm?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/315013afac238f5081e51273b6d590eb.mp4?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ded1675abdeb7b85a79f9fe0c6c65825.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Earn your place on the leaderboard or enjoy casual games with friends. Unlock rare avatars, customize your experience, and enter high-stakes competitions. Poker Warlords is free-to-play and features no pay-to-win mechanics\u2014just skill, strategy, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/7eb26881f6713d9e7cb237ecc0e6ce28.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Built by the developers of BattlePoker, a top-10 StarCraft II arcade game, Poker Warlords brings a fresh, competitive twist to both poker and autobattlers. Years of refinement, an innovative blend of strategy, and a passionate community\u2014this is poker like you\u2019ve never played before.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/01d5c92d659e8fcb8ae71d0b2208d99a.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>In Poker Warlords, each card dealt spawns a medieval fantasy army! You might get dealt a mighty 10 out of 10 Dragons or you might get a measly 8 out of 24 Footmen. Play traditional poker betting rounds with face-down and face-up cards, then choose which two armies will fight for you in battle. You have to know when to hold 'em and when to fold 'em!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/4289ab9c8b06e826b2e77dd096c42d7a.poster.avif?t=1752294894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/4289ab9c8b06e826b2e77dd096c42d7a.webm?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/4289ab9c8b06e826b2e77dd096c42d7a.mp4?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ea8dabefea6e878bad02d63f26bc26a9.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Bet smart, battle hard, then win big! After the final bet the fight begins. Armies clash in fast-paced autobattler combat. No micromanagement\u2014just smart bets, unit counters, and tactical positioning. The last army standing takes the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/e20712b9f6c6ff33044a729eb860b308.poster.avif?t=1752294894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/e20712b9f6c6ff33044a729eb860b308.webm?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/e20712b9f6c6ff33044a729eb860b308.mp4?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ee8cf7ff3c5a0b7f7d5437815a5ff8a1.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Poker is a game of deception\u2014and so is war. Read your opponents, raise with confidence, and force them to fold before the battle even starts. But be careful\u2014each unit has strengths and weaknesses. Did they just show Specters, immune to physical damage? You don't have any magic damage, but you raised anyways. You wouldn't be crazy enough to do that... would you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rich combat system provides a complementary layer to the poker betting, creating a new experience unlike any other. Each hand creates a new opportunity to flex your strategic muscle and gather all the chips into your stack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/315013afac238f5081e51273b6d590eb.poster.avif?t=1752294894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/315013afac238f5081e51273b6d590eb.webm?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/315013afac238f5081e51273b6d590eb.mp4?t=1752294894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ded1675abdeb7b85a79f9fe0c6c65825.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Earn your place on the leaderboard or enjoy casual games with friends. Unlock rare avatars, customize your experience, and enter high-stakes competitions. Poker Warlords is free-to-play and features no pay-to-win mechanics\u2014just skill, strategy, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/7eb26881f6713d9e7cb237ecc0e6ce28.avif?t=1752294894\" data-has-big /></div>Built by the developers of BattlePoker, a top-10 StarCraft II arcade game, Poker Warlords brings a fresh, competitive twist to both poker and autobattlers. Years of refinement, an innovative blend of strategy, and a passionate community\u2014this is poker like you\u2019ve never played before.</p>",
    "short_description": "Bet. Battle. Conquer! Poker Warlords fuses high-stakes poker with autobattler combat\u2014turn cards into armies, outwit opponents, and claim victory on the battlefield and at the betting table! From the creators of a top-10 StarCraft II custom game, this is poker like you've never played before.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cCombining the risk management and social bluffing elements of poker with the build-synergy elements of roguelike deck-builders makes for an unexpectedly compelling combination.\u201d<br><strong>SIX 2025 Reviewer </strong><br><br>\u201cYou still have aspects of hidden information that makes the core concept of Poker work, but there's just enough information you feel like you can maybe make smarter decisions. Incredibly well thought out game!\u201d<br><strong>SIX 2025 Reviewer</strong><br><br>\u201cCard games are not normally my favorite, but after a few minutes of the tutorial I was absolutely hooked.\u201d<br><strong>TooManyGames 2025 \u2014 Nominated for best indie game award</strong><br>",
